@startuml creator_default_entitlement
title Creator visitor identity, creator membership and IFR policy
actor Client
participant "auth.ts callback\nstate/cookie gate" as Callback
participant "fresh viewer OAuth client" as ViewerOAuth
participant "Google channels API" as IdentityAPI
participant "server session store" as Sessions
participant "authMiddleware" as Auth
participant "GET /access/check" as Access
participant "DEFAULT_ENTITLEMENT\nCONFIG.minLockIFR at startup" as Policy
participant "checkEntitlement" as Entitlement
participant "LockChecker" as Lock
participant "IFRLock contract" as Contract
participant "YouTubeChecker" as Membership
participant "separate creator OAuth client" as CreatorOAuth
participant "Google members API" as MembersAPI
Client -> Callback : code + one-use state + matching cookie
Callback -> ViewerOAuth : getToken(code) / setCredentials(tokens)
ViewerOAuth -> IdentityAPI : channels.list(id, mine=true); readonly viewer scope
IdentityAPI --> Callback : exactly one unambiguous provider channel ID
Callback -> Sessions : tokens + verified visitor ID (one-hour TTL)
Callback --> Client : JWT sid / optional proven wallet / timing claims only
Client -> Auth : bearer JWT
Auth -> Access : verified wallet / session ID
Access -> Sessions : getYouTubeSession(sid)
Sessions --> Access : verified visitor ID, or none if legacy/expired
Access -> Policy : default OR conditions
Policy --> Access : creator channel + IFR threshold string (default 1000)
Access -> Entitlement : wallet, stored visitor ID, default policy
Entitlement -> Membership : verified visitor ID + policy creator channel
alt creator credential configured and policy channel matches
  Membership -> CreatorOAuth : set creator refresh credential
  CreatorOAuth -> MembersAPI : all_current / filterByMemberChannelId / maxResults 1
  MembersAPI --> Membership : creatorChannelId + memberDetails.channelId
  Membership --> Entitlement : true only when both IDs match exactly
else missing/invalid configuration or identity
  Membership --> Entitlement : false; no membership API request
end
Entitlement -> Lock : isLocked(wallet, threshold string)
Lock -> Contract : isLocked(wallet, parseUnits(threshold, 9))
Contract --> Lock : boolean
Lock --> Entitlement : lock result
Entitlement --> Access : OR result + successful condition reasons
Access --> Client : granted / reasons
@enduml

